      "round_summary": "Round 1/3 — fixed barrel_shifter_correctness (DUT bug). Root cause: barrel-shifter stages 2-5 read from tmp0 instead of the previous stage's output, causing multi-bit rotations to compute only the MSB rotation. Changed Cat(tmp0(...)...) to Cat(tmp1(...)...) in stage-2, Cat(tmp2(...)...) in stage-3, Cat(tmp3(...)...) in stage-4, Cat(tmp4(...)...) in stage-5, establishing a proper 5-stage cascade. Also fixing the stage-3 condition (was io.amount(3), should be io.amount(2)). Expected: barrel_shifter_correctness now correctly rotates right by the full amount. load_then_rotate_by_0 may require a separate fix in a later round.",
